  "content": [
    {
      "text": "turneth the wilderness into a standing water, Ps. 107:35 (Isa. 41:18). earth shall be full of the knowledge of the Lord, Isa. 11:9 (2 Ne. 21:9). an highway for the remnant of his people, Isa. 11:16 (2 Ne. 21:16). earth shall remove out of her place, Isa. 13:13 (2 Ne. 23:13). whole earth is at rest, and is quiet, Isa. 14:7 (2 Ne. 24:7). clean dissolved, the earth is moved exceedingly, Isa. 24:19. wilderness be a fruitful field, Isa. 32:15. desert shall rejoice, and blossom as the rose, Isa. 35:1. every mountain and hill shall be made low, Isa. 40:4. way in the wilderness, and rivers in the desert, Isa. 43:19. make her wilderness like Eden, and her desert like the garden, Isa. 51:3 (2 Ne. 8:3). mountains shall depart, Isa. 54:10 (3 Ne. 22:10). Instead of the thorn shall come up the fir tree, Isa. 55:13. create new heavens and a new earth, Isa. 65:17 (66:22; 2 Pet. 3:13; Rev. 21:1; D&C 29:23). mountains shall drop down new wine, Joel 3:18.",
